WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.460
Training partner: Sorry mate, can't make it today

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.240
I think we have all been in this
situation

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.140
so today we are going to show you different ways

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.980
How to play table tennis alone!

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.720
It's like making a beat!

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:58.820
Good boy

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:07.780
Wow

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:15.880
Good job!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.960
Nooo!

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.420
Couldn't handle the compliment

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.060
There is still 70% of you guys watching

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.360
who haven't subscribed

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:24.400
so help our channel and do it now!

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.840
You don't need an opponent!

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:35.660
Switch!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.880
It's good footwork actually

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:41.840
Come on!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.380
Hope you guys got some inspiration

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.320
on how to practice without a partner

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.820
Don't forget to subscribe

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.800
And watch our previous episodes there!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.700
Until next time!

